# Uncomment to build and run a release other than the one this repository
# declares. Left unset on purpose and left without a number: the version lives
# in the Dockerfile's ARG default, docker-compose.override.yml's fallback and
# tasks.py, all three guarded by tests/unit/test_pins.py. A literal here was a
# copy none of them knew about, so `cp .env.example .env` kept handing every
# fresh clone the release the last bump had moved off.
# INFRAHUB_BASE_VERSION=
INFRAHUB_ADDRESS=http://localhost:8000
INFRAHUB_API_TOKEN=06438eb2-8019-4776-878c-0941b1f1d1ec
